// Code signing for building to your iPhone.
//
// Your Apple developer team goes in Config/Local.xcconfig, which isn't committed (scripts/setup-mac.sh writes it):
//
//   DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
//
// Because the team lives here rather than in the generated project, regenerating the project with xcodegen keeps
// it, and you don't pick the team again in Signing & Capabilities. CI builds without signing, so it doesn't need one.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
